# Changelog
## [Unreleased]
### Breaking changes
 - N/A
### New Features
 - library: Embedders can report a host network change (for example a new
   default gateway) through `MudzServer::notifier()`, so upstream groups
   which were marked dead are retried by the next query instead of failing
   fast until their retry backoff elapsed.

### Bug Fixes
 - library: SERVFAIL replies are no longer cached. A cached SERVFAIL kept
   clients failing for the minimum cache TTL after the upstream became
   reachable again, which defeated the new network-change notification
   (a group without any usable upstream transport answers a synthetic
   SERVFAIL).
